{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12104020","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12104020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1210402001:1":{"text":"치피가 상상했던 것보다 훨씬 큰 조선소네요.","source_cn":"这个造船厂比满满想象中大太多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB03ED49FC82896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210402002:0":{"text":"신밧드, 이 조선소에는... 배가 없는 것 같은데요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，这个造船厂……好像没有船？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD90060B27760300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210402003:1":{"text":"저 성벽에 달린 대포를 봐요, 포구가 반짝반짝 빛나고 있잖아요. 여기 정말 조선소가 확실한가요? 왠지 군수 공장 느낌이 더 강한데요?","source_cn":"瞧那城墙上的大炮，炮口锃亮锃亮的。你确定这是造船厂吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090C35805E8FBEEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210402004:1":{"text":"조선소든, 군수 공장이든, 어쨌든 둘 다 무기 공장이잖아? 군수 공장이라고 했으면 이쪽으로 안 가려고 했어?","source_cn":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAC181E785053FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1210402004":{"text":"조선소든, 군수 공장이든, 어쨌든 둘 다 무기 공장이잖아? 군수 공장이라고 했으면 이쪽으로 안 가려고 했어?","source_cn":"不管是造船厂，还是军工厂，总之都是武器厂，也没什么关系吧？难道就因为是军工厂，你们就不走这条路了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAC181E785053FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210402005:1":{"text":"신밧드가... 계속 무언가를 숨기고 있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"总感觉……辛巴达没有对我们坦诚呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2BB26CDA1EED3E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210402006:1":{"text":"자, 추측은 그만해. 너희에게 솔직하지 못했다는 것 인정할게. 여기가 뭐 하는 곳인지는 사실 비밀 정보였거든.","source_cn":"好啦，别猜了。我承认，没有对你们说实话。因为这里是干什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82107F7D5B66701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210402007:0":{"text":"만약 너희가... 조심해!","source_cn":"如果你们——小心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13973EE7FA865EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210403001:0":{"text":"오... 이게 바로 마법사의 힘인가? 포탄을 막아내다니?","source_cn":"哇……这就是魔法师的力量吗？竟然能挡下炮弹？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50837C387A28C646","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오... 이게 바로 마법사의 힘인가? 포탄을 막아내다니?","female":"오... 이게 바로 마법사의 힘인가? 포탄을 막아내다니?","variant_male_record_index":"128032","variant_female_record_index":"128033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210403002:0":{"text":"대체 누가 포탄을 쏘는 거죠?!","source_cn":"谁在开炮？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600D6F8ABAA65394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210403003:0":{"text":"거기 너희들! 다 보인다고! 얌전히 올라오지 않으면 한 번 더 쏠 거야!","source_cn":"你们几个娃子！我看见你们了！乖乖爬上来，不然就再吃一炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8864E250504E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210403004:1":{"text":"윽... 큰일이에요, 들켰어요!","source_cn":"呃……不好，我们被发现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B98DDFABE80010D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210403005:1":{"text":"어떡하죠? 올라오라는데... 가야 할까요?","source_cn":"怎么办，我们要听他的话上去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C60B83B125CB6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210403006:1":{"text":"안 돼! 저 사람이 우리를 속이는 거라면...? 우린 벌써 몇 번이나 속았잖아.","source_cn":"不要！万一他是骗我们的……我们已经吃了几次亏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B0ABD63B15AE9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1210403007:1":{"text":"그런 조심성 아주 좋아.","source_cn":"不错，很警觉嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B7390E352C7E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1210403007":{"text":"그런 조심성 아주 좋아.","source_cn":"不错，很警觉嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B7390E352C7E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1210403008:1":{"text":"다들 너무 걱정 마. 후긴은 내 오랜 친구라, 너희를 다치게 하진 않을 거라구.","source_cn":"别担心伙计们，呼金是我的老朋友了，他不会害你们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1760EC0A4F83C3ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210403009:1":{"text":"네? 왜죠?","source_cn":"咦，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65EE7C3DBC76E106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210403010:1":{"text":"후긴은 줄곧 마법사를 찾고 있었거든. 올라가 보면 알아!","source_cn":"因为呼金等待魔法师已经太久，哈哈，你们上去就知道了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x47D627F1AB25133D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"후긴은 줄곧 마법사를 찾고 있었거든. 올라가 보면 알아!","female":"후긴은 줄곧 마법사를 찾고 있었거든. 올라가 보면 알아!","variant_male_record_index":"128042","variant_female_record_index":"128043","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"러스트 항 사람들은 거친 편이니까","source_cn":"毕竟锈锚港民风彪悍","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C5E804DA3381817","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"러스트 항 사람들은 거친 편이니까","female":"러스트 항 사람들은 거친 편이니까","variant_male_record_index":"64992","variant_female_record_index":"64993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:1:2":{"text":"조심해서 나쁠 건 없으니까","source_cn":"谨慎总是没错的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4FEEE7BD127D1B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조심해서 나쁠 건 없으니까","female":"조심해서 나쁠 건 없으니까","variant_male_record_index":"64994","variant_female_record_index":"64995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:12010417:0":{"text":"갑자기 포탄 하나가 하늘에서 떨어졌다. 다행히 내가 신속하게 반응해 마법 실드로 그것을 막아냈다.","source_cn":"一颗炮弹突然从天而降。所幸你反应迅速，用魔法护盾挡下了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C1C8A1D47A7CADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"상관 있지","source_cn":"有关系","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA4EFB0FBF3C786","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"상관 있지","female":"상관 있지","variant_male_record_index":"64988","variant_female_record_index":"64989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"상관 없어","source_cn":"没关系","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDA9665E4AA5D63","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"상관 없어","female":"상관 없어","variant_male_record_index":"64990","variant_female_record_index":"64991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flo